        },
        "description": "__Height:__ 170cm (5'7)\n__Ability:__\n~!Nagara develops a power that currently has no official name, but has been described as \"Warp\" or \"Escape\" by other characters, which allows for the transportation between 'dimensions.'!~\n\nNagara has long hair and wears the uniform the rest of his classmates do. Nagara is bored with the environment around him and feels like giving up on life. He has trouble communicating with his family and the students at school keep their distance and watch him with a cold attitude.",
